	(gr_text "NOTES:\n\nReset is added\n\n50 ohm impedance jlcpcb and oshpark branches are created\n   Oshpark is ready\n\nFPGA Pins are checked and it is correct.\n\nPA Detector Output is connected to an adc pin\n\nADC and IF lengths are matched for better phase\n\nLO path is soft bended for continuous 50 ohm\n\nRF traces are corrected with correct clearance to gnd etc.\nDifferential 50 ohm is 0.4mm corrected.\n"
